			"Message": "refactor(Initialize): Define Configure module hierarchy\n\nEstablishes the module structure for the `Configure` component by introducing `mod.rs`. This change encapsulates configuration-related logic—specifically logging and port management—within a dedicated namespace, aligning with the project's architectural organization and ensuring the module is correctly recognized by the Rust compiler.\n\nKey changes:\n- Created `Source/Initialize/Configure/mod.rs`.\n- Declared `Log` and `Port` as public submodules.\n- Added convenience re-exports of `ConfigureLog` and `SelectPort`.\n\nThis completes the structural definition for the configuration layer, mirroring the organization established in the Command component.",
